    let caption = '*『 Mᴇᴅɪᴀғɪʀᴇ Dᴏᴡɴʟᴏᴀᴅᴇʀ 』*\n\n *Name* : ' + fileName + '\n *Size* : ' + fileSize + '\n *Mime* : ' + mimeType + '\n' + Config.caption;
    await message.bot.sendMessage(message.chat, { document: { url: downloadUrl }, fileName: fileName, mimetype: mimeType, caption: caption }, { quoted: message });
  } catch (error) {
    return message.error(error + '\n\ncommand: mediafire', error, '*_File not found!!_*');
  }
});

// ==================== APK DOWNLOAD ====================
smd({
  pattern: 'apk',
  alias: ['modapk'],
  desc: 'Downloads apks.',
  category: 'downloader',
  filename: __filename,
  use: '<give text>'
}, async (message, appName) => {
  try {
    if (!appName) return message.reply(langText("downloader", "provide_app", {}, message.userLang || global.currentUserLang));
    let response = await smdJson('https://empiretech-api.hf.space/api/search/aptoide?apikey=efe123&q=' + appName);
    if (!response || !response.success || !response.result) return message.reply(langText("downloader", "not_found", {}, message.userLang || global.currentUserLang));
    let appData = response.result;
    const downloadLink = appData.download_url;
    if (!downloadLink) return message.reply(langText("msgs", "not_found", {}, message.userLang || global.currentUserLang));
    let caption = '*『 ᗩᑭᏦ  ᗞᝪᗯᑎᒪᝪᗩᗞᗴᖇ 』*\n\n*APP Name :* ' + appData.name + '\n' + Config.caption;
    const fileName = (appData?.name || 'app') + '.apk';
    const filePath = './temp/' + fileName;
    let sentMsg = await message.reply(appData.icon, { caption: caption }, 'image', message);
    axios.get(downloadLink, { responseType: 'stream' }).then(response => {
      const writer = fs.createWriteStream(filePath);
      response.data.pipe(writer);
      return new Promise((resolve, reject) => { writer.on('finish', resolve); writer.on('error', reject); });
    }).then(() => {
      message.bot.sendMessage(message.chat, { document: fs.readFileSync(filePath), mimetype: 'application/vnd.android.package-archive', fileName: fileName }, { quoted: sentMsg });
      try { fs.unlinkSync(filePath); } catch {}
    }).catch(() => {
      try { fs.unlink(filePath); } catch {};
      message.reply(langText("msgs", "file_not_found", {}, message.userLang || global.currentUserLang));
    });
  } catch (error) {
    await message.error(error + '_File not found!!!_', error, '*_Apk not Found, Sorry_*');
  }
});

// ==================== APK SEARCH ====================
cmd({
  pattern: 'apks',
  alias: ['apksearch'],
  desc: 'Searches APKs on aptoide.',
  category: 'downloader',
  filename: __filename,
  use: '<Search Query>'
}, async (message, query) => {
  try {
    if (!query) return await message.reply(langText("downloader", "provide_app", {}, message.userLang || global.currentUserLang));
    let response = await smdJson('https://empiretech-api.hf.space/api/search/aptoide?apikey=efe123&q=' + query);
    if (!response || !response.success || !response.result) return message.reply(langText("downloader", "not_found", {}, message.userLang || global.currentUserLang));
    let appData = response.result;
    let listMsg = '*ᴇᴍᴘɪʀᴇ-ᴍᴅ • ᴀᴘᴋ ᴅᴏᴡɴʟᴏᴀᴅ ʟɪsᴛ* \n*________________________________* \n\n*_Reply Any Number To Download._*\n_Results For : ' + query + '_ \n';
    listMsg += '\n*1 : ' + appData.name + '* \n*Download :* ' + appData.download_url + '* \n';
    return await message.bot.sendMessage(message.chat, { image: { url: appData.icon }, caption: listMsg }, { quoted: message });
  } catch (error) {
    message.error(error + "*_Uhh dear, Give me App Name!_*", error);
  }
});

// ==================== TEXT TO SPEECH ====================
smd({
  pattern: 'tts',
  desc: 'text to speech.',
  category: 'downloader',
  filename: __filename,
  use: '<Hii,this is Empire>'
}, async (message, text) => {
  try {
    let ttsText = message.reply_text ? message.reply_text : text;
    if (!ttsText) return message.reply(langText("downloader", "tts_example", {}, message.userLang || global.currentUserLang));

    const audioUrl = googleTTS.getAudioUrl(ttsText, {
      lang: 'en',
      slow: false,
      host: 'https://translate.google.com'
    });

    return await message.bot.sendMessage(message.chat, {
      audio: { url: audioUrl },
      mimetype: 'audio/mpeg',
      fileName: 'tts.mp3',
      ptt: true
    }, { quoted: message });

  } catch (error) {
    return message.error(error + '_audio file not Found!!_', error, false);
  }
});

// ==================== DOWNLOAD MP4 FROM URL ====================
smd({
  pattern: 'downmp4',
  alias: ['mp4down', 'mp4fromurl'],
  desc: 'download mp4 from url.',
  category: 'downloader',
  use: '<url>',
  filename: __filename
}, async (message, url) => {
  try {
    let videoUrl = ('' + (url ? url : message.reply_text)).split(' ')[0].toLowerCase();
    if (!videoUrl || !videoUrl.includes('.mp4')) return message.reply(langText("downloader", "video_url_example", { prefix }, message.userLang || global.currentUserLang));
    var type = url.toLowerCase().includes('doc') ? 'document' : 'video';
    let videoBuffer = await getBuffer(videoUrl);
    await message.bot.sendMessage(message.chat, { [type]: videoBuffer, caption: '*_Here\'s Your Video_\n*', mimetype: 'video/mp4', contextInfo: { ...(await message.bot.contextInfo(Config.botname, message.pushName)) } }, { quoted: message });
  } catch (error) {
    await message.error(error + '*_Video not found!_*', error, '*_Video Not Found!_*');
  }
});

// ==================== YOUTUBE VIDEO DOWNLOADER (UPDATED URL ONLY) ====================
smd({
  pattern: 'video',
  alias: ['ytmp4', 'ytv', 'ytvid'],
  desc: 'Downloads video from YouTube via search.',
  category: 'downloader',
  filename: __filename,
  use: '<search query or url>'
}, async (message, input) => {
  try {
    let query = input ? input : message.reply_text;
    if (!query) return message.reply(langText("downloader", "provide_query", {}, message.userLang || global.currentUserLang));

    var isDoc = query.toLowerCase().includes('doc');
    let videoUrl = query;
    let title = query;

    if (!/youtu\.be|youtube\.com/.test(videoUrl)) {
      let searchResults = await yts(query);
      if (!searchResults.videos || !searchResults.videos[0]) return await message.reply(langText("msgs", "no_result", {}, message.userLang || global.currentUserLang));
      videoUrl = searchResults.videos[0].url;
      title = searchResults.videos[0].title;
    }

    // NEW API URL for video only
    let downloadResponse = await fetchJson(`https://eliteprotech-apis.zone.id/ytdown?url=${videoUrl}&format=mp4`);

    if (!downloadResponse || !downloadResponse.success) return await message.reply(langText("downloader", "download_failed", {}, message.userLang || global.currentUserLang));

    let downloadUrl = downloadResponse.downloadURL;

    if (!downloadUrl) return await message.reply(langText("msgs", "video_not_found", {}, message.userLang || global.currentUserLang));

    await message.reply(`\`\`\`Downloading ${title}\`\`\``);

    if (isDoc) {
      return await message.bot.sendMessage(message.chat, {
        document: { url: downloadUrl },
        fileName: 'Empire-Md-video.mp4',
        mimetype: 'video/mp4',
        caption: Config.caption
      }, { quoted: message });
    } else {
      return await message.bot.sendMessage(message.chat, {
        video: { url: downloadUrl },
        caption: Config.caption,
        mimetype: 'video/mp4'
      }, { quoted: message });
    }

  } catch (error) {
    return message.error(error + '\n\ncommand: video', error, '*_Video not Found_*');
  }
});

// ==================== YOUTUBE AUDIO DOWNLOADER (KEPT ORIGINAL) ====================
smd({
  pattern: 'audio',
  alias: ['yta'],
  desc: 'Downloads audio from YouTube via search.',
  category: 'downloader',
  filename: __filename,
  use: '<search query or url>'
}, async (message, input) => {
  try {
    let query = input ? input : message.reply_text;
    if (!query) return message.reply(langText("downloader", "provide_query", {}, message.userLang || global.currentUserLang));

    var isDoc = query.toLowerCase().includes('doc');
    let videoUrl = query;
    let title = query;

    if (!/youtu\.be|youtube\.com/.test(videoUrl)) {
      let searchResults = await yts(query);
      if (!searchResults.videos || !searchResults.videos[0]) return await message.reply(langText("msgs", "no_result", {}, message.userLang || global.currentUserLang));

      videoUrl = searchResults.videos[0].url;
      title = searchResults.videos[0].title;
    }

    let downloadResponse = await smdJson(api_smd + '/api/download/ytmp3?apikey=efe123&url=' + videoUrl);
    if (!downloadResponse || !downloadResponse.success) return await message.reply(langText("downloader", "download_failed", {}, message.userLang || global.currentUserLang));

    let downloadUrl = downloadResponse.result;
    if (!downloadUrl) return await message.reply(langText("msgs", "audio_not_found", {}, message.userLang || global.currentUserLang));

    await message.reply(`\`\`\`Downloading ${title}\`\`\``);

    let audioBuffer = await getBuffer(downloadUrl);

    if (isDoc) {
      return await message.bot.sendMessage(message.chat, {
        document: audioBuffer,
        fileName: 'Empire-Md-audio.mp3',
        mimetype: 'audio/mpeg'
      }, {
        quoted: message
      });
    } else {
      return await message.bot.sendMessage(message.chat, {
        audio: audioBuffer,
        mimetype: 'audio/mpeg'
      }, {
        quoted: message
      });
     }
  } catch (error) {
    return message.error(error + '\n\ncommand: audio', error, '*_Audio not Found_*');
  }
});
// ==================== RINGTONE DOWNLOADER ====================
smd({
  pattern: 'ringtone',
  alias: ['sound'],
  desc: 'Downloads ringtones by number (1-160).',
  category: 'downloader',
  filename: __filename,
  use: '<number 1-160>'
}, async (message, number) => {
  try {
    if (!number) return message.reply(langText("downloader", "provide_number", { prefix }, message.userLang || global.currentUserLang));
    const soundNumber = parseInt(number);
    if (isNaN(soundNumber) || soundNumber < 1 || soundNumber > 160) return message.reply(langText("downloader", "invalid_number", {}, message.userLang || global.currentUserLang));
    let soundUrl = 'https://github.com/DGXeon/Tiktokmusic-API/raw/master/tiktokmusic/sound' + soundNumber + '.mp3';
    let audioBuffer = await getBuffer(soundUrl);
    var contextInfo = { ...(await message.bot.contextInfo(Config.botname, 'Ringtone ' + soundNumber)) };
    return message.bot.sendMessage(message.chat, { audio: audioBuffer, fileName: 'Ringtone ' + soundNumber + '.mp3', mimetype: 'audio/mpeg', ptt: true, contextInfo: contextInfo }, { quoted: message });
  } catch (error) {
    return message.error(error + '*_Ringtone not found!!_*', error, false);
  }
});

